      "title": "Adjunct Undergraduate Nursing",
      "description": "Adjunct Undergraduate Nursing - Marian University We value your privacy We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalised ads or content, and analyse our traffic. By clicking \"Accept All\", you consent to our use of cookies. Customise Reject All Accept All Customise Consent Preferences We use cookies to help you navigate efficiently and perform certain functions. You will find detailed information about all cookies under each consent category below. The cookies that are categorised as \"Necessary\" are stored on your browser as they are essential for enabling the basic functionalities of the site. ... Show more Necessary Always Active Necessary cookies are required to enable the basic features of this site, such as providing secure log-in or adjusting your consent preferences. These cookies do not store any personally identifiable data. Cookie __cf_bm Duration 1 hour Description This cookie, set by Cloudflare, is used to support Cloudflare Bot Management. Cookie checkForPermission Duration 10 minutes Description This cookie is set by Beeswax to determine whether the user has accepted the cookie consent box. Cookie rc::a Duration Never Expires Description This cookie is set by the Google recaptcha service to identify bots to protect the website against malicious spam attacks. Cookie rc::c Duration session Description This cookie is set by the Google recaptcha service to identify bots to protect the website against malicious spam attacks. Cookie PHPSESSID Duration session Description This cookie is native to PHP applications. The cookie stores and identifies a user's unique session ID to manage user sessions on the website. The cookie is a session cookie and will be deleted when all the browser windows are closed. Cookie cookieyes-* Duration 1 year Description CookieYes sets this cookie for consent solution management. Cookie ARRAffinitySameSite Duration session Description This cookie is set by Windows Azure cloud, and is used for load balancing to make sure the visitor page requests are routed to the same server in any browsing session. Cookie ARRAffinity Duration session Description ARRAffinity cookie is set by Azure app service, and allows the service to choose the right instance established by a user to deliver subsequent requests made by that user. Functional Functional cookies help perform certain functionalities like sharing the content of the website on social media platforms, collecting feedback, and other third-party features. Cookie li_gc Duration 6 months Description Linkedin set this cookie for storing visitor's consent regarding using cookies for non-essential purposes. Cookie lidc Duration 1 day Description LinkedIn sets the lidc cookie to facilitate data center selection. Analytics Analytical cookies are used to understand how visitors interact with the website. These cookies help provide information on metrics such as the number of visitors, bounce rate, traffic source, etc. Cookie TAPID Duration 1 year Description Tealium sets this cookie to install a unique ID when a visitor first visits and thus keep track of visitors between domains. Cookie MUID Duration 1 year 24 days Description Bing sets this cookie to recognise unique web browsers visiting Microsoft sites. This cookie is used for advertising, site analytics, and other operations. Cookie _ga_* Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to store and count page views. Cookie _ga Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Google Analytics sets this cookie to calculate visitor, session and campaign data and track site usage for the site's analytics report. The cookie stores information anonymously and assigns a randomly generated number to recognise unique visitors. Performance Performance cookies are used to understand and analyse the key performance indexes of the website which helps in delivering a better user experience for the visitors. No cookies to display. Advertisement Advertisement cookies are used to provide visitors with customised advertisements based on the pages you visited previously and to analyse the effectiveness of the ad campaigns. Cookie _twpid Duration 1 year 24 days Description Description is currently not available. Cookie _twsid Duration 1 year 24 days Description Description is currently not available. Cookie taxitag_main__sn Duration 1 year Description Description is currently not available. Cookie taxitag_main__se Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie taxitag_main__ss Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie taxitag_main__st Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie taxitag_main_ses_id Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie taxitag_main__pn Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie taxitag_main_v_id Duration 1 year Description Description is currently not available. Cookie taxitag_main_dc_visit Duration 1 year Description Description is currently not available. Cookie taxitag_main_dc_event Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie taxitag_main_dc_region Duration 1 hour Description Description is currently not available. Cookie __ss Duration 1 day Description This cookie is set by SharpSpring, a marketing automation platform. This is used for tracking visitors and form submissions. Cookie __ss_referrer Duration 1 hour Description This cookie is set by SharpSpring, a marketing automation platform. This is used for tracking visitors and form submissions. Cookie koitk Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description This cookie is set by SharpSpring, a marketing automation platform. This is used for tracking visitors and form submissions. Cookie _gcl_au Duration 3 months Description Google Tag Manager sets this cookie to experiment advertisement efficiency of websites using their services. Cookie __ss_tk Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description This cookie is set by SharpSpring, a marketing automation platform. This is used for tracking visitors and form submissions. Cookie barometric[cuid] Duration 1 year Description Claritas sets this cookie to collect visitor statistics. This data is used to categorize users and improve the effectiveness of website advertising. Cookie personalization_id Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Twitter sets this cookie to integrate and share features for social media and also store information about how the user uses the website, for tracking and targeting. Cookie muc_ads Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description Twitter sets this cookie to collect user behaviour and interaction data to optimize the website. Cookie bcookie Duration 1 year Description LinkedIn sets this cookie from LinkedIn share buttons and ad tags to recognize browser IDs. Cookie bito Duration 1 year 1 month Description Beeswax sets this cookie as a unique ID for the visitor, which allows third-party advertisers to target the visitor with relevant advertisements. This pairing service is provided by third-party advertisement hubs, which facilitate real-time bidding for advertisers. Cookie bitoIsSecure Duration 1 year 1 month Description Beeswax sets this cookie to display the user relevant content and advertisements. The service is provided by third-party advertisement hubs, which facilitate real-time bidding for advertisers. Cookie _fbp Duration 3 months Description Facebook sets this cookie to store and track interactions. Cookie barometric[idfa] Duration past Description Claritas sets this cookie to collect visitor statistics. This data is used to categorize users and improve the effectiveness of website advertising. Cookie CDNPHPSESSID Duration session Description Description is currently not available. Cookie WFESessionId Duration session Description No description available. Cookie test_cookie Duration 15 minutes Description doubleclick.net sets this cookie to determine if the user's browser supports cookies. Cookie IDE Duration 1 year 24 days Description Google DoubleClick IDE cookies store information about how the user uses the website to present them with relevant ads according to the user profile. Cookie _mkto_trk Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description This cookie, provided by Marketo, has information (such as a unique user ID) that is used to track the user's site usage. The cookies set by Marketo are readable only by Marketo. Cookie _uetsid Duration 1 day Description Bing Ads sets this cookie to engage with a user that has previously visited the website. Cookie _uetvid Duration 1 year 24 days Description Bing Ads sets this cookie to engage with a user that has previously visited the website. Uncategorised Other uncategorised cookies are those that are being analysed and have not been classified into a category as yet. No cookies to display. Reject All Save My Preferences Accept All Powered by Skip to content en | es Alumni Founder’s Day Give Host Your Event Marian Cares MyMarian Request Info Sabre Café Virtual Tour search field Alumni Founder’s Day Give Host Your Event Marian Cares MyMarian Request Info Sabre Café Virtual Tour Academics Study Area Business Criminal Justice Education Liberal Arts Math & Science Nursing, Human Services and Healthcare By Degree Level Undergraduate Graduate Minors Licenses & Certificates Campus Online Registrar Apply Now Admission Undergraduate Direct Admit Common Application Apply Online Ways To Earn College Credit AP CLEP IB Graduate Online Returning International Students Veterans and Military Veterans Military Withdrawal and Refund Post-Graduation Job Opportunities Recruiting, Marketing, and Advertising Transfer Students Accepted Transfer Credits Ways to Earn College Credit Admitted Students Early College Credit Transferology Cost and Aid Cost of Attending Undergraduate Online Undergraduate Adult Graduate Financial Aid Determining Eligibility Applying for Aid Your Offer Receiving Aid Accepting Loans Paying Your Bills Maintaining Eligibility Canceling or Changing Your Aid FAFSA Financial Aid Policies Return of Federal Funds Tuition Refund Satisfactory Academic Progress Financial Aid Fraud Scholarships & Grants Graduate Aid Working Families Program Partnership Discounts Net Price Calculator Forms & Resources FAQ Athletics Student Life Health & Wellness Counseling Nurse Emergency Care Student Health Insurance Student Organizations Spiritual Life Diversity and Inclusion Student Store Residence Life/Housing & Dining Housing Dining Parking Orientation Student Services Academic Resources First-Year Students Honors Program Learning & Writing Center Institutional Review Board (IRB) Math Placement Library Research Databases & Guides Research Tips Library Services Circulation Policy Copyright Policy Privacy and Confidentiality Policy Selection and Acquisitions Policy Guest Use Policy TRIO Office of Student Success Career & Professional Development Koonce Scholars Program Accessibility Resources About Marian Accreditation and Approvals Campus Map Directory Employment Founder’s Day History Media Kit Mission and Values News President Special Events State Authorization Student Consumer Information Title IX Title IX Support and Appeals Travel University Profile Adjunct Undergraduate Nursing Brad Greenwood 2026-01-29T13:10:48-06:00 Categories: Instructional, Adjunct Undergraduate Nursing Marian University is a Catholic applied liberal arts community that welcomes diverse spiritual traditions. Sponsored by the Congregation of Sisters of St. Agnes, Marian University engages students in the education of the whole person. We embrace justice compassion and transform lives for professional service and leadership. Work Type : Part-time Department Opening: Undergraduate Nursing Marian University invites applications for Adjunct Faculty in Undergraduate Nursing, beginning August 2026 . We are seeking passionate educators who are committed to excellence in teaching and student engagement. Successful candidates will join a collaborative team dedicated to preparing future nurses for compassionate, evidence-based, and ethical practice. Teaching responsibilities include in-person instruction in undergraduate nursing courses at our Fond du Lac, Wisconsin campus. Courses are part of the Bachelor of Science in Nursing (BSN) program, designed to develop students’ critical thinking, clinical reasoning, and professional competencies for success in diverse healthcare environments. Primary Responsibilities Deliver engaging, evidence-based lectures and active learning experiences aligned with course and program outcomes. Facilitate in-person class and clinical sessions that promote professional growth and clinical judgment. Foster a positive and inclusive learning environment that encourages participation, reflection, and collaboration. Evaluate student performance through assignments, exams, clinical evaluation tools, and participation. Provide timely, constructive feedback and support to help students achieve course outcomes. Maintain regular communication and availability for student advising and mentorship. Collaborate with course coordinators and faculty teams to ensure program quality and consistency. Minimum Qualifications Master’s degree in Nursing or a related field required. Active, unencumbered Registered Nurse (RN) license. Prior teaching experience in a clinical or academic setting preferred. Excellent communication, organizational, and interpersonal skills. Demonstrated ability to create an inclusive and supportive learning environment. Authorization to work in the United States. Preferred Qualifications Experience with simulation-based or hybrid/online instruction. Familiarity with CCNE accreditation standards and competency-based education. Current clinical experience in an acute or community health setting. Application Requirements: Please submit a letter of interest, resume/CV, unofficial transcripts, and name, address and telephone number of three references to muapplicants@marianuniversity.edu . Please enter in the subject line “Adjunct, Graduate Nursing” Terms of Appointment: open-ended, continual as needed Salary: Competitive Application Deadline: Review of files will begin immediately and continue until available positions are filled. More information about Marian University can be found by clicking HERE . Marian University is committed to building a culturally diverse employee workforce and strongly encourages women, minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply. Sponsored by the Congregation of Sisters of St. Agnes 45 S. National Ave. Fond du Lac, Wisconsin 54935-4699 800-262-7426 admission@marianuniversity.edu Follow Us #Fightbluefight Apply to Marian Request Information Donate to Marian Schedule a Tour Employment Copyright © 2025 Marian University. Privacy Policy Title IX Sponsored by the Congregation of Sisters of St. Agnes 45 S. National Ave. Fond du Lac, Wisconsin 54935-4699 800.262.7426 info@marianuniversity.edu Follow Us #Fightbluefight Toggle Navigation Apply to Marian Request Information Donate to Marian Schedule a Visit Employment Privacy Policy Title IX Copyright © 2025 Marian University. Page load link Arabic Chinese (Simplified) Dutch English French German Hmong Italian Japanese Korean Nepali Portuguese Russian Spanish Swedish Vietnamese en Go to Top"
